  "source": "LOOP EVERY 10s\n     IF   AT_BoarAirSensor.Read_Temp(C) > 26\n     DO\n          AT_BoarAirSensor.Fan_On(50)\n     ELSE\n          AT_BoarAirSensor.Fan_Off()\n     END\nEND",
